###
### تسجيل دخول
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### Response:
#{
#  "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",
#  "user": {
#    "id": "...",
#    "email": "admin@example.com",
#    "fullName": "Admin User"
#  }
#}

### استخدام التوكن
GET http://localhost:3000/orders
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...
